  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Incoming mission green hydrogen India</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In collaboration with the Netherlands embassy in New Delhi, India, a five-day &apos;Hydrogen Valleys &amp; Hubs&apos; mission was organised in the Netherlands. Building on previous initiatives and strengthening the existing partnership in green hydrogen, the mission aimed to further advance bilateral cooperation. Establishing green hydrogen valleys and hubs was identified as a key area of mutual interest, with significant opportunities for collaboration.The Netherlands is committed to playing an active and constructive role in the development of a global hydrogen economy and is at the forefront of European efforts to drive the hydrogen revolution. This commitment is supported by the country&apos;s strategic location as the gateway to North-Western Europe and its position as a key hub in global trade, with the necessary infrastructure already in place.Both public and private stakeholders, as well as academic institutions, from both India and the Netherlands participated in the mission. Knowledge-sharing sessions were organised, complemented by site visits to Europe&apos;s first hydrogen valley, several innovation valleys, and attendance at the European Hydrogen Week in Brussels.</narrative>
  </description>
